{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42971","headline":"书事 · 何赞","name":"书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"果决生涯向路中，西投知己话从容。\n云遮剑阁三千里，水隔瞿塘十二峰。\n阔步文翁坊里月，闲寻杜老宅边松。\n到头须卜林泉隐，自愧无能继卧龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}